<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Experiments, Tucker Wieland</title>
<meta name="description" content="Motion and atmosphere experiments for the personal site.">
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono';
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: optional;
    src: url('/assets/fonts/ibm-plex-mono-latin-400-normal.woff2') format('woff2');
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono';
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: optional;
    src: url('/assets/fonts/ibm-plex-mono-latin-700-normal.woff2') format('woff2');
  }
  :root {
    --bg: #0b0c11;
    --ink: #ffffff;
    --ink-2: rgb(255 255 255 / 55%);
    --ink-3: rgb(255 255 255 / 32%);
    --line: rgb(255 255 255 / 10%);
    --warm: #f2e7d3;
  }
  *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  ::selection { background: #f2efe8; color: #101218; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #f2efe8; outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 2px; }
  main { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 18vh 20px 20vh; }
  .kicker {
    font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .exp-list { list-style: none; }
  .exp-item { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .exp-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .exp-link {
    display: block; padding: 28px 4px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;
  }
  .exp-name { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--warm); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .exp-desc { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 0.92rem; max-width: 58ch; }
  .exp-link:hover .exp-name { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .back { display: inline-block; margin-top: 3rem; color: var(--ink-3); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .back:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  footer { text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px 56px; color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 0.78rem; }
  @media (width >= 640px) { main { padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <p class="kicker">Site experiments</p>
  <h1>Motion studies</h1>
  <ul class="exp-list">
    <li class="exp-item">
      <a class="exp-link" href="/experiments/atmosphere/">
        <p class="exp-name">Atmosphere</p>
        <p class="exp-desc">The full page carried on ambient weather. Dust drifting like sunbeam dust, a breathing light shaft, thin film grain, and scroll choreography that stays out of the way.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li class="exp-item">
      <a class="exp-link" href="/experiments/flythrough/">
        <p class="exp-name">Flythrough</p>
        <p class="exp-desc">A slow camera drift through the Strata field, one composed waypoint per section.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li class="exp-item">
      <a class="exp-link" href="/experiments/drift/">
        <p class="exp-name">Drift</p>
        <p class="exp-desc">Pure form, motion, and light. Breathing glow masses, a soft particle flow field, film grain, and a vignette that deepens as you scroll. No lines, no contours, just drift.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li class="exp-item">
      <a class="exp-link" href="/experiments/descent/">
        <p class="exp-name">Descent</p>
        <p class="exp-desc">Quiet surrealism. A page you sink through: a fixed moon left behind, deepening darkness, and one mid-page moment where gravity shifts.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <a class="back" href="/">&#8592; Back to the site</a>
</main>
<footer>
  <p>&copy; 2026 Tucker Wieland.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
